            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention describes a hydraulic lift module (100), which comprises a hydraulic lift cylinder (10), which comprises a cylinder barrel (16) and a piston rod (18), wherein the cylinder barrel (16) comprises a cap end (14) at one end portion of the cylinder barrel (16) and a rod end (12) at the other end portion of the cylinder barrel (16), wherein the piston rod (18) extends outwards from the cylinder barrel (16) at the rod end (12) of the cylinder barrel (16). The hydraulic lift module (100) further comprises a hydraulic unit (50), which is hydraulically connected to the hydraulic lift cylinder (10), wherein the hydraulic unit (50) is configured to provide and generate a hydraulic fluid flow actuating the hydraulic lift cylinder (10), a bracket (20), which is attached to the cylinder barrel (16), wherein the hydraulic unit (50) is attached to the bracket (20), and at least one component of a hinge (30), which is arranged at the cap end (14) of the cylinder barrel (16).</p>
            </abstract>
